{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 19,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 224.192,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, the dimness shall not be such as was in her vexation,",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.87,
      "end": 7.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when at first he lightly afflicted the land of Zebulun,",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.115,
      "end": 10.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the land of Naphtali,",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.292,
      "end": 17.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and afterwards did more grievously afflict by the way of the Red Sea beyond Jordan in Galilee of the nations.",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 18.217,
      "end": 21.839,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The people that walked in darkness have seen a great light;",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.019,
      "end": 27.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they that dwell in the land of the shadow of death, upon them hath the light shined.",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 27.993,
      "end": 29.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou hast multiplied the nation,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.077,
      "end": 31.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and increased the joy\u2014",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.697,
      "end": 34.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they joy before thee according to the joy in harvest,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 34.988,
      "end": 38.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as men rejoice when they divide the spoil.",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.826,
      "end": 41.334,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For thou hast broken the yoke of his burden,",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 41.514,
      "end": 43.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the staff of his shoulder,",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 43.598,
      "end": 45.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the rod of his oppressor.",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 45.903,
      "end": 49.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For every battle of the warrior is with confused noise,",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.241,
      "end": 51.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and garments rolled in blood;",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 51.418,
      "end": 54.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but this shall be with burning and fuel of fire.",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 55.302,
      "end": 57.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For unto us a child is born,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 57.572,
      "end": 59.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto us a son is given;",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.61,
      "end": 62.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the government shall be upon his shoulder;",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 62.391,
      "end": 66.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his name shall be called, Wonderful, Counselor,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 66.333,
      "end": 67.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Mighty God,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 67.906,
      "end": 69.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Everlasting Father,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 69.665,
      "end": 71.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Prince of Peace.",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 71.878,
      "end": 76.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Of the increase of government and peace there is no end, upon the throne of David,",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 77.12,
      "end": 79.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon his kingdom to order it,",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 79.576,
      "end": 82.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to establish it with judgment",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 82.217,
      "end": 85.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with justice from henceforth, even forever.",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 85.416,
      "end": 88.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The zeal of the Lord of Hosts will perform this.",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 88.836,
      "end": 91.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Lord sent his word unto Jacob",
      "verse": "19:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 91.292,
      "end": 93.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it hath lighted upon Israel.",
      "verse": "19:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 94.34,
      "end": 96.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all the people shall know,",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 96.238,
      "end": 99.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even Ephraim and the inhabitants of Samaria,",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 99.855,
      "end": 102.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that say in the pride and stoutness of heart:",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 103.368,
      "end": 105.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The bricks are fallen down,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 105.452,
      "end": 107.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we will build with hewn stones;",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 107.722,
      "end": 109.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the sycamores are cut down,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 109.945,
      "end": 112.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we will change them into cedars.",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 113.133,
      "end": 117.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore the Lord shall set up the adversaries of Rezin against him,",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 117.26,
      "end": 119.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and join his enemies together;",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 120.03,
      "end": 123.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Syrians before and the Philistines behind;",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 123.461,
      "end": 126.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall devour Israel with open mouth.",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 126.335,
      "end": 128.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For all this his anger is not turned away,",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 128.93,
      "end": 131.298,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but his hand is stretched out still.",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 131.978,
      "end": 134.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the people turneth not unto him that smiteth them,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 135.177,
      "end": 137.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither do they seek the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 138.179,
      "end": 141.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore will the Lord cut off from Israel head and tail,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 141.796,
      "end": 143.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "branch and rush in one day.",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 144.287,
      "end": 146.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The ancient, he is the head;",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 146.417,
      "end": 148.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the prophet that teacheth lies,",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 149.058,
      "end": 150.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he is the tail.",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 151.038,
      "end": 153.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the leaders of this people cause them to err;",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 154.051,
      "end": 157.255,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they that are led of them are destroyed.",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 157.935,
      "end": 161.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore the Lord shall have no joy in their young men,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 161.226,
      "end": 164.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall have mercy on their fatherless and widows;",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 164.61,
      "end": 168.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for every one of them is a hypocrite and an evildoer,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 168.459,
      "end": 170.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and every mouth speaketh folly.",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 170.775,
      "end": 173.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For all this his anger is not turned away,",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 173.37,
      "end": 175.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but his hand is stretched out still.",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 176.418,
      "end": 178.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For wickedness burneth as the fire;",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 178.874,
      "end": 181.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it shall devour the briers and thorns,",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 181.562,
      "end": 184.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall kindle in the thickets of the forests,",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 184.436,
      "end": 187.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall mount up like the lifting up of smoke.",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 188.32,
      "end": 191.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Through the wrath of the Lord of Hosts is the land darkened,",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 192.169,
      "end": 195.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the people shall be as the fuel of the fire;",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 195.739,
      "end": 197.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "no man shall spare his brother.",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 198.648,
      "end": 200.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall snatch on the right hand",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 201.057,
      "end": 202.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be hungry;",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 202.537,
      "end": 205.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall eat on the left hand",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 205.225,
      "end": 207.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall not be satisfied;",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 207.402,
      "end": 211.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall eat every man the flesh of his own arm\u2014",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 211.844,
      "end": 213.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Manasseh, Ephraim;",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 213.557,
      "end": 215.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Ephraim, Manasseh;",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 215.92,
      "end": 218.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they together shall be against Judah.",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 218.561,
      "end": 220.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For all this his anger is not turned away,",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 221.156,
      "end": 223.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but his hand is stretched out still.",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 77
    }
  ]
}